msgid "# MiniMax-M3.1-Flash (Experimental)"
msgstr "# MiniMax-M3.1-Flash（实验性）"

msgid "## 1 Introduction"
msgstr "## 1 简介"

msgid ""
"The \"PD Separation Deployment\" mentioned in this document is provided only"
" as an example/reference design to demonstrate the basic process of "
"deploying Prefill and Decode in separated mode. It is not recommended for "
"use in the production environment."
msgstr ""
"本文档中提到的“PD 分离部署”仅作为示例/参考设计提供，用于演示以分离模式部署 Prefill 和 Decode 的基本流程。不建议在生产环境中使用。"

msgid ""
"**For the production environment on the customer side, [MindIE "
"Motor](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/en/mindie/latest/quickstart/docs/en/user_guide/quick_start.md)"
" + vLLM-Ascend is recommended.**"
msgstr ""
"**对于客户侧的生产环境，推荐使用 [MindIE "
"Motor](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/en/mindie/latest/quickstart/docs/en/user_guide/quick_start.md)"
" + vLLM-Ascend。**"

msgid ""
"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash is a multimodal Mixture-of-Experts model with "
"approximately 428B total parameters and 23B activated parameters per token. "
"It uses sparse attention throughout the model."
msgstr ""
"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash 是一个多模态混合专家（MoE）模型，总参数量约为 428B，每个 token 的激活参数量为 "
"23B。该模型在整个模型中使用了稀疏注意力。"

msgid ""
"This document covers supported features, environment and model preparation, "
"single-node deployment, PD separation, functional verification, accuracy and"
" performance evaluation, performance tuning, and troubleshooting."
msgstr "本文档涵盖支持的特性、环境与模型准备、单节点部署、PD 分离、功能验证、精度与性能评估、性能调优以及故障排查。"

msgid "**Current status and constraints**"
msgstr "**当前状态与约束**"

msgid ""
"- `MiniMax-M3.1-Flash` is provided **out-of-the-box** through the Docker images described in [Installation](#4-installation). The supporting code has **not yet been merged** into the vLLM-Ascend repository, so installing it from source (`pip install` or building from source) is **not supported** for this model yet.\n"
"    - The features listed in [Supported Features](#2-supported-features) are only those enabled by the verified deployment commands in this document, and do **not** imply that all features are supported for `MiniMax-M3.1-Flash`. This is an early-access version; performance optimization and reliability validation are still in progress."
msgstr ""
"- `MiniMax-M3.1-Flash` 通过 [安装](#4-installation) 中所述的 Docker 镜像**开箱即用**提供。相关支持代码**尚未合并**到 vLLM-Ascend 仓库中，因此目前**不支持**通过源码安装（`pip install` 或从源码构建）该模型。\n"
"    - [支持的特性](#2-supported-features) 中列出的特性仅为本文档中已验证的部署命令所启用的特性，**并不**意味着 `MiniMax-M3.1-Flash` 支持所有特性。这是一个抢先体验版本，性能优化和可靠性验证仍在进行中。"

msgid "## 2 Supported Features"
msgstr "## 2 支持的特性"

msgid ""
"Refer to the [Supported "
"Models](../../user_guide/support_matrix/supported_models.md) page for the "
"support matrix and the [Feature "
"Guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/index.md) for feature configuration."
msgstr ""
"支持矩阵请参阅[支持的模型](../../user_guide/support_matrix/supported_models.md)页面，特性配置请参阅[特性指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/index.md)。"

msgid "## 3 Prerequisites"
msgstr "## 3 前提条件"

msgid "### 3.1 Model Weight"
msgstr "### 3.1 模型权重"

msgid ""
"The official release of MiniMax-M3.1-Flash is available on [Hugging "
"Face](https://huggingface.co/MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-M3.1-Flash). However, its "
"routed MoE experts use the NVFP4 data format, which cannot run directly on "
"Ascend hardware. The following quantized weights are adapted for Ascend:"
msgstr ""
"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash 的官方发布版本可在 [Hugging "
"Face](https://huggingface.co/MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-M3.1-Flash) 上获取。然而，其路由 MoE "
"专家使用 NVFP4 数据格式，无法直接在昇腾硬件上运行。以下量化权重已适配昇腾："

msgid "| Weight Version | Deployment | Model Path |"
msgstr "| 权重版本 | 部署方式 | 模型路径 |"

msgid ""
"| MiniMax-M3.1-Flash-W8A8 | Atlas 800I A2, tow-node PD colocation <br> Atlas"
" 800I A3, three-node PD disaggregation (1P2D) | "
"[ModelScope](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-"
"Tech/Minimax-M3.1-Flash-w8a8) |"
msgstr ""
"| MiniMax-M3.1-Flash-W8A8 | Atlas 800I A2，双节点 PD 混部 <br> Atlas 800I A3，三节点 "
"PD 分离（1P2D） | [ModelScope](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-"
"Tech/Minimax-M3.1-Flash-w8a8) |"

msgid ""
"| MiniMax-M3.1-Flash-MXFP8 | 950DT products, three-node PD disaggregation "
"(1P2D) | [ModelScope](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-"
"Tech/Minimax-M3.1-Flash-w8a8-mxfp8) |"
msgstr ""
"| MiniMax-M3.1-Flash-MXFP8 | Ascend 950DT系列产品，三节点 PD 分离（1P2D） | "
"[ModelScope](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-"
"Tech/Minimax-M3.1-Flash-w8a8-mxfp8) |"

msgid ""
"Download the weight variant used by the serving commands to the same model "
"directory on all participating nodes. It is recommended to place the model "
"weight in a shared cache directory."
msgstr "将服务命令所使用的权重变体下载到所有参与节点上相同的模型目录中。建议将模型权重放置在共享缓存目录中。"

msgid "### 3.2 Verify Multi-node Communication"
msgstr "### 3.2 验证多节点通信"

msgid ""
"Prepare the business network and the NPU interconnect by following\n"
"[Verify inter-node connectivity](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-multi-node-interconnect)."
msgstr ""
"按照[验证节点间连通性](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-multi-node-"
"interconnect)的说明准备业务网络和 NPU 互联。"

msgid ""
"On each host, use `ip addr` or `ifconfig` to identify the host communication"
" IP and the interface that owns it. Set `LOCAL_IP` to that IP and `NIC_NAME`"
" to the interface name; for example, if the IP is assigned to `eth0`, set "
"`NIC_NAME=\"eth0\"`. The scripts use this interface for both "
"`HCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME` and `GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME`. See [multi-node host "
"configuration](../../developer_guide/contribution/multi_node_test.md#2-test-"
"without-kubernetes) for selecting mutually reachable host IPs."
msgstr ""
"在每台主机上，使用 `ip addr` 或 `ifconfig` 确定主机通信 IP 及其所属的网络接口。将 `LOCAL_IP` 设置为该 IP，将 "
"`NIC_NAME` 设置为接口名称；例如，如果该 IP 分配在 `eth0` 上，则设置 `NIC_NAME=\"eth0\"`。脚本将该接口同时用于"
" `HCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME` 和 `GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME`。关于如何选择可互相访问的主机 "
"IP，请参阅[多节点主机配置](../../developer_guide/contribution/multi_node_test.md#2-test-"
"without-kubernetes)。"

msgid "## 4 Installation"
msgstr "## 4 安装"

msgid "### 4.1 A2 Docker Container"
msgstr "### 4.1 A2 Docker 容器"

msgid ""
"Run the following on each A2 host. Set the model path to the W8A8 "
"checkpoint."
msgstr "在每台 A2 主机上运行以下命令。将模型路径设置为 W8A8 检查点。"

msgid "### 4.2 A3 Docker Container"
msgstr "### 4.2 A3 Docker 容器"

msgid ""
"Run the following on each A3 host. Set the model path to the W8A8 "
"checkpoint."
msgstr "在每台 A3 主机上运行以下命令。将模型路径设置为 W8A8 检查点。"

msgid "### 4.3 950DT products Docker Container"
msgstr "### 4.3 Ascend 950DT系列产品 Docker 容器"

msgid ""
"Run the following on each 950DT products host. Set the model path to the "
"W8A8-MXFP8 checkpoint."
msgstr "在每台 Ascend 950DT系列产品主机上运行以下命令。将模型路径设置为 W8A8-MXFP8 检查点。"

msgid "## 5 Online Service Deployment"
msgstr "## 5 在线服务部署"

msgid ""
"Use the container and model weights for your hardware from "
"[Installation](#4-installation)."
msgstr "使用[安装](#4-installation)中适用于您硬件的容器和模型权重。"

msgid ""
"For descriptions of the standard `vllm serve` arguments used in the "
"deployment examples, refer to the [vLLM Serving Arguments "
"documentation](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/cli/serve/#arguments). For "
"Ascend-specific options passed through `--additional-config`, refer to "
"[Additional "
"Configuration](../../user_guide/configuration/additional_config.md). For "
"Ascend-specific environment variables, refer to [Environment "
"Variables](../../user_guide/configuration/env_vars.md)."
msgstr ""
"关于部署示例中使用的标准 `vllm serve` 参数的说明，请参阅 [vLLM "
"服务参数文档](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/cli/serve/#arguments)。关于通过 "
"`--additional-config` "
"传递的昇腾专用选项，请参阅[附加配置](../../user_guide/configuration/additional_config.md)。关于昇腾专用环境变量，请参阅[环境变量](../../user_guide/configuration/env_vars.md)。"

msgid ""
"**Note**: In the scripts below, `max-num-seqs` represents the maximum number"
" of sequences the scheduler can process in a single iteration. Adjust the "
"`max-num-seqs` parameter dynamically based on actual business."
msgstr ""
"**注意**：在以下脚本中，`max-num-seqs` 表示调度器在单次迭代中可处理的最大序列数。请根据实际业务动态调整 `max-num-seqs`"
" 参数。"

msgid ""
"`MAX_MODEL_LEN` is a shell variable whose value is passed to the vLLM "
"argument `--max-model-len`. The examples use the following context budgets:"
msgstr ""
"`MAX_MODEL_LEN` 是一个 shell 变量，其值会传递给 vLLM 参数 `--max-model-len`。示例使用以下上下文预算："

msgid "| Deployment | MAX_MODEL_LEN |"
msgstr "| 部署方式 | MAX_MODEL_LEN |"

msgid ""
"These values belong to different deployment profiles. Weights, communication"
" buffers, parallelism, and KV caches share device memory, so a context "
"budget that fits one profile may not fit another. Select a value that covers"
" the prompt and generated tokens together, and check available KV cache "
"capacity at the intended concurrency. The `1M` model limit in the support "
"matrix does not mean every example configuration reserves enough memory for "
"1M-token requests. To use the `263000` setting reported in [Text "
"Evaluation](#72-text-evaluation), update `MAX_MODEL_LEN` in the serving "
"scripts, including both roles for PD deployment, and recheck memory capacity"
" before evaluation."
msgstr ""
"这些取值属于不同的部署配置。权重、通信缓冲区、并行策略和 KV "
"缓存共享设备内存，因此适合某一配置的上下文预算未必适合另一配置。请选择一个能同时覆盖提示词和生成 token 的取值，并在目标并发度下检查可用的 KV "
"缓存容量。支持矩阵中的 `1M` 模型上限并不意味着每个示例配置都为 100 万 token 的请求预留了足够内存。如需使用 "
"[文本评测](#72-text-evaluation) 中报告的 `263000` 设置，请更新服务脚本中的 `MAX_MODEL_LEN`（PD "
"部署时需同时更新两个角色的脚本），并在评测前重新检查内存容量。"

msgid ""
"For text-only deployment, `--limit-mm-per-prompt` can be omitted. For "
"multimodal deployment, configure this parameter according to the actual "
"request shape. For example, use `--limit-mm-per-prompt "
"'{\"image\":2,\"video\":0}'` for two-image requests, and use `--limit-mm-"
"per-prompt '{\"image\":0,\"video\":1}'` for one-video requests."
msgstr ""
"对于纯文本部署，可以省略 `--limit-mm-per-prompt`。对于多模态部署，请根据实际请求形态配置该参数。例如，对于双图请求使用 "
"`--limit-mm-per-prompt '{\"image\":2,\"video\":0}'`，对于单视频请求使用 `--limit-mm-"
"per-prompt '{\"image\":0,\"video\":1}'`。"

msgid "### 5.1 Single-Node Deployment"
msgstr "### 5.1 单节点部署"

msgid ""
"Single-node deployment runs Prefill and Decode on the same host. Both "
"examples use W8A8 weights and [DSpark speculative "
"decoding](../../user_guide/feature_guide/speculative_decoding.md#speculating-"
"using-dspark), which generates draft tokens and verifies them with the "
"target model. They use all 16 NPUs on A3 or all eight NPUs on 950DT "
"products."
msgstr ""
"单节点部署在同一主机上运行 Prefill 和 Decode。两个示例均使用 W8A8 权重和 [DSpark "
"投机解码](../../user_guide/feature_guide/speculative_decoding.md#speculating-"
"using-dspark)，该方式生成草稿 token 并由目标模型进行验证。它们分别使用 A3 上的全部 16 个 NPU 或 Ascend "
"950DT系列产品上的全部 8 个 NPU。"

msgid "=== \"A3 series (W8A8)\""
msgstr "=== \"A3系列（W8A8）\""

msgid "**Start the Service**"
msgstr "**启动服务**"

msgid ""
"Run the following inside the A3 container. It starts one API service with "
"DP4 x TP4 / EP16 across all 16 NPUs, using W8A8 weights and DSpark "
"speculative decoding with seven draft tokens."
msgstr ""
"在 A3 容器内运行以下命令。它会在全部 16 个 NPU 上以 DP4 x TP4 / EP16 启动一个 API 服务，使用 W8A8 权重和带 7"
" 个草稿 token 的 DSpark 投机解码。"

msgid ""
"Set `MODEL_PATH` to your model weight directory; the following example uses "
"the container mount path configured in [Section 4](#4-installation)."
msgstr ""
"将 `MODEL_PATH` 设置为你的模型权重目录；以下示例使用 [第 4 节](#4-installation) 中配置的容器挂载路径。"

msgid ""
"Wait for the following startup messages, then check the health endpoint from"
" another terminal in the container:"
msgstr "等待出现以下启动消息，然后在容器内的另一个终端中检查健康检查端点："

msgid ""
"Expected output: `200`. Send requests to port `11223` with model name "
"`minimax-m3.1-flash`. If startup is still in progress or fails, follow "
"[Startup Troubleshooting](#102-model-loading-is-still-in-progress-or-"
"startup-fails)."
msgstr ""
"预期输出：`200`。使用模型名称 `minimax-m3.1-flash` 向端口 `11223` 发送请求。如果启动仍在进行中或失败，请参阅 "
"[启动故障排查](#102-model-loading-is-still-in-progress-or-startup-fails)。"

msgid "=== \"950DT products\""
msgstr "=== \"Ascend 950DT系列产品\""

msgid "**Start the Service**"
msgstr "**启动服务**"

msgid ""
"Run the following inside the 950DT products container. It uses DP2 x TP4 / "
"EP8 across all eight NPUs, W8A8-MXFP8 weights, and DSpark speculative "
"decoding with seven draft tokens."
msgstr ""
"在 Ascend 950DT系列产品容器内运行以下命令。它在全部 8 个 NPU 上使用 DP2 x TP4 / EP8、W8A8-MXFP8 "
"权重，以及带 7 个草稿 token 的 DSpark 投机解码。"

msgid ""
"Set `MODEL_PATH` to your model weight directory; the following example uses "
"the container mount path configured in [Section 4](#4-installation)."
msgstr ""
"将 `MODEL_PATH` 设置为你的模型权重目录；以下示例使用 [第 4 节](#4-installation) 中配置的容器挂载路径。"

msgid ""
"Wait for the following startup messages, then check the health endpoint from"
" another terminal in the container:"
msgstr "等待出现以下启动消息，然后在容器内的另一个终端中检查健康检查端点："

msgid ""
"Expected output: `200`. Send requests to port `11223` with model name "
"`minimax-m3.1-flash`. If startup is still in progress or fails, follow "
"[Startup Troubleshooting](#102-model-loading-is-still-in-progress-or-"
"startup-fails)."
msgstr ""
"预期输出：`200`。使用模型名称 `minimax-m3.1-flash` 向端口 `11223` 发送请求。如果启动仍在进行中或失败，请参阅 "
"[启动故障排查](#102-model-loading-is-still-in-progress-or-startup-fails)。"

msgid "### 5.2 Multi-Node Deployment"
msgstr "### 5.2 多节点部署"

msgid ""
"Multi-Node deployment runs Prefill and Decode on the same host, but there "
"are more than one host node. Both nodes use DSpark speculative decoding with"
" seven draft tokens and probabilistic draft sampling. Configure the host-"
"specific values at the beginning of each node script before starting the "
"service."
msgstr ""
"多节点部署在同一主机上运行 Prefill 和 Decode，但主机节点不止一个。两个节点均使用带 7 个草稿 token 和概率草稿采样的 "
"DSpark 投机解码。启动服务前，请在每个节点脚本的开头配置各主机专属的取值。"

msgid ""
"Monitor node log while weights load and graph capture completes. Startup "
"duration depends on storage, hardware, and the selected configuration; use "
"continuing log progress and `Application startup complete` to judge "
"readiness. If logs stop progressing or report an error, follow [Startup "
"Troubleshooting](#102-model-loading-is-still-in-progress-or-startup-fails)."
msgstr ""
"在权重加载和图捕获完成期间监控节点日志。启动时长取决于存储、硬件和所选配置；请根据日志是否持续输出以及是否出现 `Application startup"
" complete` 来判断是否就绪。如果日志停止输出或报告错误，请参阅 [启动故障排查](#102-model-loading-is-still-"
"in-progress-or-startup-fails)。"

msgid "=== \"A2 series (W8A8)\""
msgstr "=== \"A2系列（W8A8）\""

msgid ""
"There are two A2 nodes, DP4 × TP4 / EP16 in total. The following values "
"match the configurations in the node scripts below and summarize the "
"differences between the two nodes."
msgstr "共有两个 A2 节点，总计 DP4 × TP4 / EP16。以下取值与下方节点脚本中的配置一致，并概述了两个节点之间的差异。"

msgid "| Parameter | Node 0 | Node 1 |"
msgstr "| 参数 | 节点 0 | 节点 1 |"

msgid "    | Role | API server | Headless worker |"
msgstr "    | 角色 | API 服务器 | 无头工作节点 |"

msgid "    | DP × TP | 2 × 4 | 2 × 4 |"
msgstr "    | DP × TP | 2 × 4 | 2 × 4 |"

msgid "**Node 0**"
msgstr "**节点 0**"

msgid "Save the following as `run_node0.sh` on node 0."
msgstr "在节点 0 上将以下内容保存为 `run_node0.sh`。"

msgid "Start the engine inside the node 0 container:"
msgstr "在节点 0 容器内启动引擎："

msgid "**Node 1**"
msgstr "**节点 1**"

msgid ""
"Save the following as `run_node1.sh` on node 1. `HEAD_NODE_IP` is the "
"business network IP of node 0."
msgstr "在节点 1 上将以下内容保存为 `run_node1.sh`。`HEAD_NODE_IP` 是节点 0 的业务网络 IP。"

msgid "Start the engine inside the node 1 container:"
msgstr "在节点 1 容器内启动引擎："

msgid ""
"Node 1 is headless and does not open an HTTP server. After node 0 prints the"
" following startup messages, check the health endpoint from another terminal"
" in the node 0 container:"
msgstr "节点 1 为无头模式，不开放 HTTP 服务器。在节点 0 打印以下启动消息后，在节点 0 容器内的另一个终端中检查健康检查端点："

msgid ""
"Expected output: `200`. Send requests to port `11223` on node 0 with model "
"name `minimax-m3.1-flash`."
msgstr "预期输出：`200`。使用模型名称 `minimax-m3.1-flash` 向节点 0 的端口 `11223` 发送请求。"

msgid "### 5.3 PD Disaggregation (1P2D)"
msgstr "### 5.3 PD 分离（1P2D）"

msgid ""
"Both platforms use one Prefill node and two Decode nodes (1P2D), with "
"Prefill and Decode on separate hosts. Both platforms use DSpark speculative "
"decoding with seven draft tokens and probabilistic draft sampling. Configure"
" the host-specific values at the beginning of each Prefill and Decode script"
" before starting the service."
msgstr ""
"两个平台均使用一个 Prefill 节点和两个 Decode 节点（1P2D），Prefill 和 Decode 位于不同主机上。两个平台均使用带 7 "
"个草稿 token 和概率草稿采样的 DSpark 投机解码。启动服务前，请在每个 Prefill 和 Decode 脚本的开头配置各主机专属的取值。"

msgid ""
"Monitor the role logs while weights load and graph capture completes. "
"Startup duration depends on storage, hardware, and the selected "
"configuration; use continuing log progress to monitor initialization, and "
"wait for `Application startup complete` on each HTTP-serving instance to "
"judge readiness. Headless workers join the distributed Decode service "
"without exposing their own HTTP API. If logs stop progressing or report an "
"error, follow [Startup Troubleshooting](#102-model-loading-is-still-in-"
"progress-or-startup-fails) before starting the proxy."
msgstr ""
"在权重加载和图捕获完成期间监控各角色的日志。启动时长取决于存储、硬件和所选配置；请根据日志是否持续输出来监控初始化过程，并等待每个提供 HTTP "
"服务的实例出现 `Application startup complete` 以判断是否就绪。无头工作节点加入分布式 Decode "
"服务，但不对外暴露自己的 HTTP API。如果日志停止输出或报告错误，请在启动代理之前参阅 [启动故障排查](#102-model-loading-"
"is-still-in-progress-or-startup-fails)。"

msgid "=== \"A3 series (W8A8)\""
