"runs global DP ranks 0–3, and D2 runs ranks 4–7. Each rank starts one TP4 "
"service on four local NPUs. All eight Decode ranks share the D1 "
"communication IP as their DP master address and use the same RPC port. Use "
"the same image and weights on all three nodes."
msgstr ""
