msgid "## 9 Performance Tuning"
msgstr "## 9 性能调优"

msgid "### 9.1 Recommended Configurations"
msgstr "### 9.1 推荐配置"

msgid ""
"Use the commands in [Section 5](#5-online-service-deployment) as starting "
"configurations. They are not globally optimal: the appropriate settings "
"depend on request lengths, concurrency, prefix-cache hit rate, and the "
"available device memory. Evaluate each adjustment with the same workload and"
" compare latency, throughput, and memory use."
msgstr ""
"请将[第 5 节](#5-online-service-"
"deployment)中的命令作为起始配置。它们并非全局最优：合适的设置取决于请求长度、并发度、前缀缓存命中率以及可用的设备内存。请使用相同的工作负载评估每次调整，并比较时延、吞吐量和内存使用情况。"

msgid ""
"| Scenario | Starting Configuration | Parameters to Evaluate | Validation |"
msgstr "| 场景 | 起始配置 | 待评估参数 | 验证 |"

msgid ""
"| Long context | A3 PD example with `MAX_MODEL_LEN=263000`; the other "
"examples start at `133000`. | Set `MAX_MODEL_LEN` for the combined "
"input/output budget and reduce `--max-num-seqs` if KV cache capacity is "
"insufficient. | Confirm the requested context fits at the target concurrency"
" before increasing load. |"
msgstr ""
"| 长上下文 | 使用 `MAX_MODEL_LEN=263000` 的 A3 PD 示例；其他示例从 `133000` 开始。 | "
"根据输入/输出总预算设置 `MAX_MODEL_LEN`，如果 KV 缓存容量不足，则减小 `--max-num-seqs`。 | "
"在增加负载之前，确认所请求的上下文在目标并发度下能够容纳。 |"

msgid ""
"| Low latency | Single-node examples in Section 5.1. | Reduce request "
"concurrency and compare `--max-num-seqs` and `--max-num-batched-tokens` "
"settings. | Compare TTFT and TPOT alongside output-token throughput. |"
msgstr ""
"| 低时延 | 第 5.1 节中的单节点示例。 | 降低请求并发度，并比较 `--max-num-seqs` 和 `--max-num-batched-"
"tokens` 设置。 | 在比较输出 token 吞吐量的同时比较 TTFT 和 TPOT。 |"

msgid ""
"| High throughput | PD examples in Section 5.3. | Adjust `MAX_NUM_SEQS` and "
"`MAX_BATCHED_TOKENS` on Prefill and Decode separately while keeping both "
"connector topology declarations consistent. | Increase offered load "
"gradually and check throughput, latency, and failed requests. |"
msgstr ""
"| 高吞吐 | 第 5.3 节中的 PD 示例。 | 分别调整 Prefill 和 Decode 上的 `MAX_NUM_SEQS` 和 "
"`MAX_BATCHED_TOKENS`，同时保持两处 connector 拓扑声明一致。 | 逐步增加施加的负载，并检查吞吐量、时延和失败请求。 |"

msgid "### 9.2 Tuning Guidelines"
msgstr "### 9.2 调优指南"

msgid ""
"The examples explicitly enable FlashComm1 and seven-token DSpark. On 950DT "
"products, the PD main model uses FP8 KV cache while the DSpark draft uses "
"BF16 KV cache. Preserve that distinction when tuning; the draft cache dtype "
"is configured inside `--speculative-config`."
msgstr ""
"这些示例显式启用了 FlashComm1 和七 token 的 DSpark。在 Ascend 950DT系列产品上，PD 主模型使用 FP8 KV "
"缓存，而 DSpark draft 使用 BF16 KV 缓存。调优时请保持这一区别；draft 缓存的数据类型在 `--speculative-"
"config` 中配置。"

msgid ""
"Change one parameter at a time and retain the command and benchmark result "
"for each run. For general methods, refer to [Optimization and "
"Tuning](../../developer_guide/performance_and_debug/optimization_and_tuning.md)."
" For feature descriptions and configuration constraints, refer to the "
"[Feature Matrix](../../user_guide/support_matrix/feature_matrix.md) and "
"[Speculative Decoding "
"Guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/speculative_decoding.md#speculating-"
"using-dspark)."
msgstr ""
"每次只更改一个参数，并保留每次运行的命令和基准测试结果。通用方法请参阅[优化与调优](../../developer_guide/performance_and_debug/optimization_and_tuning.md)。功能说明和配置约束请参阅[特性矩阵](../../user_guide/support_matrix/feature_matrix.md)和[投机推理指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/speculative_decoding.md#speculating-"
"using-dspark)。"

