msgstr ""
"有关常见的环境、安装和通用参数问题，请参阅[公共常见问题](../../faqs.md)。本节介绍 MiniMax-M3.1-Flash "
"特有的部署问题。"

msgid "### 10.1 DSpark Draft Initialization Fails with FP8 KV Cache"
msgstr "### 10.1 使用 FP8 KV 缓存时 DSpark Draft 初始化失败"

msgid ""
"**Symptom:** A 950DT products PD service fails while initializing the DSpark"
" draft because FP8 KV quantization parameters are missing."
msgstr ""
"**现象：** Ascend 950DT系列产品上的 PD 服务在初始化 DSpark draft 时因缺少 FP8 KV 量化参数而失败。"

msgid ""
"**Cause:** The draft inherits the main model's FP8 KV cache configuration "
"unless a draft cache dtype is specified."
msgstr "**原因：** 除非指定 draft 缓存的数据类型，否则 draft 会继承主模型的 FP8 KV 缓存配置。"

msgid ""
"**Resolution:** Keep the main-model argument `--kv-cache-dtype fp8`, and set"
" `kv_cache_dtype` to `bfloat16` inside `--speculative-config` on both "
"Prefill and Decode:"
msgstr ""
"**解决方案：** 保留主模型参数 `--kv-cache-dtype fp8`，并在 Prefill 和 Decode 两端的 "
"`--speculative-config` 中将 `kv_cache_dtype` 设置为 `bfloat16`："

msgid ""
"The scripts in Section 5.3 already include this setting. It changes only the"
" draft KV cache dtype."
msgstr "第 5.3 节的脚本已包含此设置。它仅更改草稿 KV 缓存的数据类型。"

msgid "### 10.2 Model Loading Is Still in Progress or Startup Fails"
msgstr "### 10.2 模型仍在加载中或启动失败"

msgid ""
"**Symptom:** The API is not ready while loading the approximately "
"428B-parameter checkpoint or capturing graphs."
msgstr "**现象：** 在加载约 428B 参数的检查点或捕获图时，API 尚未就绪。"

msgid ""
"**Cause:** Weight loading, initialization, and graph capture depend on "
"storage speed, the hardware, and the selected configuration. Elapsed time "
"alone does not distinguish ongoing initialization from a failure."
msgstr "**原因：** 权重加载、初始化和图捕获取决于存储速度、硬件以及所选配置。仅凭经过的时间无法区分正在进行的初始化与故障。"

msgid ""
"**Resolution:** Follow the foreground logs for single-node deployment. For "
"PD deployment, use `tail -f prefill.log` on Prefill; use `tail -f "
"decode-0.log decode-1.log decode-2.log decode-3.log` on A3 D1 and `tail -f "
"decode-4.log decode-5.log decode-6.log decode-7.log` on A3 D2; use `tail -f "
"decode.log` on each 950DT products Decode node. Allow initialization to "
"continue while logs show progress. Send requests or start the PD proxy after"
" every required service prints `Application startup complete`; the single-"
"node health check must return `200`."
msgstr ""
"**解决方法：** 单节点部署时跟踪前台日志。PD 部署时，在 Prefill 上使用 `tail -f prefill.log`；在 A3 D1 "
"上使用 `tail -f decode-0.log decode-1.log decode-2.log decode-3.log`，在 A3 D2 "
"上使用 `tail -f decode-4.log decode-5.log decode-6.log decode-7.log`；在每个 Ascend"
" 950DT系列产品 Decode 节点上使用 `tail -f "
"decode.log`。只要日志显示有进展，就允许初始化继续进行。待所有必需的服务都打印 `Application startup complete` "
"后，再发送请求或启动 PD 代理；单节点健康检查必须返回 `200`。"

msgid ""
"If logs stop progressing or the process exits, inspect the first error in "
"every affected role log. Check that `MODEL_PATH` points to the matching "
"weight variant mounted in Section 4, confirm the expected devices are "
"visible with `npu-smi info`, and compare the actual startup command with the"
" corresponding platform example. For PD communication failures, also recheck"
" `LOCAL_IP`, `NIC_NAME`, and [inter-node connectivity](#32-verify-multi-"
"node-communication). For memory errors, review the context budget and "
"concurrency described in [Section 5](#5-online-service-deployment) and the "
"[out-of-memory FAQ](../../faqs.md#12-how-to-handle-the-out-of-memory-issue)."
msgstr ""
"如果日志停止推进或进程退出，请检查每个受影响角色日志中的首个错误。检查 `MODEL_PATH` 是否指向第 4 节中挂载的匹配权重变体，使用 "
"`npu-smi info` 确认预期设备可见，并将实际启动命令与对应平台示例进行对比。对于 PD 通信故障，还需重新检查 "
"`LOCAL_IP`、`NIC_NAME` 以及[节点间连通性](#32-verify-multi-node-"
"communication)。对于内存错误，请查阅[第 5 节](#5-online-service-"
"deployment)中描述的上下文预算和并发设置，以及[内存不足常见问题](../../faqs.md#12-how-to-handle-the-"
"out-of-memory-issue)。"
